  m_Name: NoteData_Cat
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  statueName: Bastet
  pages:
  - 'Cats were VERY special in ancient Egypt!

    This is Bastet, the goddess of
    cats,

    home, and happiness.


    Egyptians loved their cats so much

    that
    hurting one was against the law!

'
  - "Cats protected Egyptian homes\nfrom mice and snakes.\nSo they were treated like
    royalty!\n\nIf a cat died, the whole family\nwould be very sad and mourn together.\n\nDo
    you have a cat at home?  \U0001F431"
  statueIllustration: {fileID: 1075993247170539406, guid: 198657ea7a6a73490a465b9f4a6f4538, type: 3}
